tients with ACS during the COVID-19 pandemic was to be expected. However, initial reports from small registries have shown remarkable reductions in the number of\n\n) Springer", "width": 1654, "height": 2197, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Clinical Research in Cardiology (2023) 112:539-549", "bbox": {"x": 140.5, "y": 92.6, "width": 463.0, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "545", "bbox": {"x": 1472.0, "y": 92.6, "width": 41.5, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Table 1 Baseline characteristics", "bbox": {"x": 140.5, "y": 159.7, "width": 309.7, "height": 22.400000000000006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Year", "bbox": {"x": 140.5, "y": 207.6, "width": 47.900000000000006, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "STEMI", "bbox": {"x": 443.8, "y": 207.5, "width": 76.69999999999999, "height": 25.69999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2020", "bbox": {"x": 443.8, "y": 252.3, "width": 54.30000000000001, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2019", "bbox": {"x": 590.6, "y": 252.1, "width": 54.39999999999998, "height": 25.900000000000006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2018", "bbox": {"x": 737.6, "y": 252.3, "width": 57.5, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "NSTEMI", "bbox": {"x": 977.0, "y": 207.3, "width": 95.90000000000009, "height": 26.099999999999994}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2020", "bbox": {"x": 977.1, "y": 252.3, "width": 57.499999999999886, "height": 25.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Age < 70 years Age > 80 years Male sex Elixhauser Comorbidity index Hypertension Diabetes Renal failure", "bbox": {"x": 140.2, "y": 305.2, "width": 291.0, "height": 228.59999999999997}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Congestive heart failure Valvular disease", "bbox": {"x": 140.5, "y": 549.2, "width": 229.89999999999998, "height": 54.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Chronic pulmonary disease Metastatic cancer", "bbox": {"x": 140.5, "y": 619.5, "width": 265.0, "height": 54.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "62.3% (2273) 63.0% (2645) 160.6% （26